# Optional. Only needed for authenticated POST /refresh, not Cron or first fetch.
# Basic /feed.xml and scheduled updates require NO secrets.
# Optional local setup: copy to .dev.vars and uncomment the following line.
# Keep this example commented so Deploy to Cloudflare requests no mandatory secrets.
# Never commit .dev.vars or real tokens.
# REFRESH_TOKEN=replace-with-a-long-random-secret

